-- Applied 2026-07-11 via Supabase MCP migration `invoices_backfill_2026`.
-- Backfill of the 2026 QuickBooks invoices for the eight current customers
-- (org "Talent Edge LLC"), pulled per-customer via the QBO MCP
-- qbo_sales_get_invoices tool and reconciled against the aggregate pull from
-- 2026-07-11 (docs/plans/2026-07-11-client-portal-design.md). 50 invoices;
-- totals verified to match exactly per company after apply. `status` is
-- derived (paid/open/overdue/voided) from balance + due_date + private_memo
-- at build time; `memo` itself (admin-only, never sent to the portal) is
-- stored only when it carried a real signal ("Voided").
on conflict (source, external_id) do update set
  balance_cents = excluded.balance_cents,
  status = excluded.status,
  synced_at = now(),
  updated_at = now();
